{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1034","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Little C Loves 3 III"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"64 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Little C loves number «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» very much. He loves all things about it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now he is interested in the following problem:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are two arrays of $$$2^n$$$ intergers $$$a_0,a_1,...,a_{2^n-1}$$$ and $$$b_0,b_1,...,b_{2^n-1}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The task is for each $$$i (0 \\leq i \\leq 2^n-1)$$$, to calculate $$$c_i=\\sum a_j \\cdot b_k$$$ ($$$j|k=i$$$ and $$$j\\&k=0$$$, where \"$$$|$$$\" denotes "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#OR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise or operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" and \"$$$\\&$$$\" denotes "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise and operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It's amazing that it can be proved that there are exactly $$$3^n$$$ triples $$$(i,j,k)$$$, such that $$$j|k=i$$$, $$$j\\&k=0$$$ and $$$0 \\leq i,j,k \\leq 2^n-1$$$. So Little C wants to solve this excellent problem (because it's well related to $$$3$$$) excellently."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help him calculate all $$$c_i$$$. Little C loves $$$3$$$ very much, so he only want to know each $$$c_i \\& 3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n (0 \\leq n \\leq 21)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$2^n$$$ integers in $$$[0,3]$$$ without spaces — the $$$i$$$-th of them is $$$a_{i-1}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$2^n$$$ integers in $$$[0,3]$$$ without spaces — the $$$i$$$-th of them is $$$b_{i-1}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one line contains $$$2^n$$$ integers in $$$[0,3]$$$ without spaces — the $$$i$$$-th of them is $$$c_{i-1}\\&3$$$. (It's obvious that $$$c_{i}\\&3$$$ is in $$$[0,3]$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n11\n11\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"12"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n0123\n3210\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0322"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1034E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1034/problem/E"}